IMPORTANT NOTES FOR THIS PROJECT
================================

1. SAMPLE DATA
   All vendors, products, prices, ratings and reviews in this project are
   FICTIONAL and were written as sample data for an academic exercise.
   No vendor named in the dataset is a real business, and no review is a
   real customer review.

2. IMAGES
   The photographs in the images/ directory are stock images sourced from
   third-party retailers and stock libraries. They are used here as
   placeholders to demonstrate the layout. They are NOT covered by the MIT
   licence above. If you publish this project publicly or commercially,
   replace them with your own photographs or images you have licensed.

3. CHECKOUT DEMO
   The checkout form validates input and calculates totals entirely in the
   browser. It does not process payments and does not transmit data to any
   server. Do not use it to collect real customer information without
   building a proper backend.
